{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/08e4285552135c0b856f2c7dc053ad42.avif?t=1761129525\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in your hospital room in the middle of the night and you don't know how much time has passed. Find a way out of this nightmare before it\u2019s too late. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/0b5d3748fa032e9c6676cf994730a987.avif?t=1761129525\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something must be wrong, <strong>being in the dark hurts</strong>. You have to get out before that thing finds you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/db02337390ff8b5bc17717643d9ba220.poster.avif?t=1761129525\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/db02337390ff8b5bc17717643d9ba220.webm?t=1761129525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/db02337390ff8b5bc17717643d9ba220.mp4?t=1761129525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/5fd5c64bb049938fae5ed9d6f75f4a30.avif?t=1761129525\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather tools and information to help you solve puzzles and overcome drawbacks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/6c1bc1ef61089c0e78bb16f51d551f49.poster.avif?t=1761129525\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/6c1bc1ef61089c0e78bb16f51d551f49.webm?t=1761129525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/6c1bc1ef61089c0e78bb16f51d551f49.mp4?t=1761129525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/d33c4f9ab91bdab797d6e481019860dc.avif?t=1761129525\" width=614 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help out and befriend survivors scattered across the hospital in order to advance towards the exit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/8eae88404e5aa239176c821d4347dd40.poster.avif?t=1761129525\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/8eae88404e5aa239176c821d4347dd40.webm?t=1761129525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/extras/8eae88404e5aa239176c821d4347dd40.mp4?t=1761129525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3091260?t=1761129525","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/f5322fd47c73fd6a729c604037ca63b545e757c7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761129525","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091260/4bf17f40d2bd566bd8d3d65c536c63f791f82c08/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761129525","capsule_i